<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/5/eng@/~cl_13> <https://schema.org/text> "Subsection 328(2) of the Ordinance is amended by deleting the words \"paragraph 2 of Article 6 of\"."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/5/eng@> .
