<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/5/eng@/~cl_2__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "by substituting for the definition of \"Load Line Convention\" the following definition: ' \"Load Lines Convention\" means the International Convention of Load Lines signed in London on the 5th April 1966; and if any amendment of the Load Lines Convention comes into force with respect to BILL Malaysia, references in this Ordinance to the Load Lines Convention shall, unless the context otherwise requires, be construed as references to the Load Lines Convention as amended;\"."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/5/eng@> .
