<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/5/eng@/~cl_4__subsec_2__para_c> <https://schema.org/text> "may prescribe on any other matter which may appear to the Minister to be expedient or necessary for the better carrying out of this section."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/5/eng@> .
