<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/5/eng@/~cl_5> <https://schema.org/text> "Paragraph 65B(2)(c) of the Ordinance is amended by inserting after the words \"Ministry of\" the word \"International\"."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/5/eng@> .
